          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP460

(FOUND)

dnfapalooza for me in the SPNA today, i'd noticed a brasscap in the middle of my targetted caching zone for the day, so made sure it made it into my gps.  after 3 consecutive DNF's here, i figured i'd head over to this guy, reading some of the previous logs, it was going to be fairly cool.  Well more intersting than most, and way better than a DNF :)&lt;/p&gt;

