          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP460 Old Edmonton Trail

Did a run out to this one before the start of the hockey game. Not too surprising that there was no one else in the natural area. It's definitely spring though, the frogs were croaking up a storm. We've been here a few times and even made note of the sign, but not enough to log the cap. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks outforthehunt for these BCPs. &lt;/p&gt;

